<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Hurts from everyday life (Source/ColonyCouncil/Harm/WorkHurts.cs): a strained back worked through four hours of heavy
    work in a day, untended and out of bed, tears one time in ten and becomes this, in the strain's place. It never comes
    on its own (no causes), never kills and leaves no mark.
  -->

  <HediffDef ParentName="Council_AilmentBase">
    <defName>Council_Ail_TornBack</defName>
    <label>torn back</label>
    <description>A strained back worked through until the muscle tore: sharp pain with every bend and lift, and weeks to mend. Bed rest at the start helps most, then only light work; tending (strapping, a warm compress, something for the pain) speeds it along. It comes only from working on with a strained back instead of resting it.</description>
    <initialSeverity>0.65</initialSeverity>
    <tendable>true</tendable>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.HediffCompProperties_Ailment">
        <key>TornBack</key>
        <cooldownDays>30</cooldownDays>
        <notes>
          <li>Bed for the first days, then nothing heavier than a cup until it mends. A strain is a warning, and this is what comes of ignoring one.</li>
          <li>[lowtech] Warm stones in a cloth, a tight wrap and a week in bed, then no lifting for a month.</li>
          <li>[!lowtech] Heat, painkillers and strict rest at first, then gentle stretching. Weeks, not days.</li>
        </notes>
      </li>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_TendDuration">
        <baseTendDurationHours>72</baseTendDurationHours>
        <severityPerDayTended>0</severityPerDayTended>
      </li>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.HediffCompProperties_AilmentMedicine">
        <severityPerDayTended>-0.04</severityPerDayTended>
      </li>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.HediffCompProperties_AilmentRecovery">
        <severityPerDay>-0.025</severityPerDay>
        <bedFactor>2</bedFactor>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>mending</label>
        <painOffset>0.08</painOffset>
        <statFactors><CarryingCapacity>0.8</CarryingCapacity></statFactors>
        <capMods>
          <li><capacity>Moving</capacity><offset>-0.08</offset></li>
          <li><capacity>Manipulation</capacity><offset>-0.04</offset></li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.35</minSeverity>
        <label>torn</label>
        <painOffset>0.18</painOffset>
        <statFactors><CarryingCapacity>0.5</CarryingCapacity></statFactors>
        <capMods>
          <li><capacity>Moving</capacity><offset>-0.2</offset></li>
          <li><capacity>Manipulation</capacity><offset>-0.1</offset></li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

</Defs>
